* @title Fullscan palindrome recognizer with RTAB and ABORT
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Appendix D, Solution 2.9
* @input >>>
* LEVEL
* ABBA
* SNOBOL
* A MAN A PLAN A CANAL PANAMA
* <<<
* @expect >>>
* "LEVEL" IS A PALINDROME.
* "ABBA" IS A PALINDROME.
* "SNOBOL" IS NOT A PALINDROME.
* "A MAN A PLAN A CANAL PANAMA" IS NOT A PALINDROME.
* <<<
          &FULLSCAN = 1; &TRIM = 1
          PALIN = LEN(1) $ H @X (*GT(2 * X, SIZE(S)) |
+                *RTAB(X) @Y @Z (*H @Z | *EQ(Y,Z) ABORT) FAIL)
READ      S = INPUT :F(END)
          S PALIN :F(NO)
          OUTPUT = '"' S '" IS A PALINDROME.' :(READ)
NO        OUTPUT = '"' S '" IS NOT A PALINDROME.' :(READ)
END
